# <type>(<scope>): <subject> (max 50 chars)

# <body> (optional, max 72 chars per line)

# <footer> (optional)

# Type can be:
#   feat:     新功能
#   fix:      修复bug
#   docs:     仅文档更改
#   style:    不影响代码含义的更改（空格、格式、缺少分号等）
#   refactor: 既不修复bug也不添加功能的代码更改
#   perf:     改进性能的代码更改
#   test:     添加缺失或纠正现有测试
#   chore:    对构建过程或辅助工具和库的更改
#   revert:   回滚之前的提交
#
# Scope is optional and can be anything specifying the place of the commit change.
# Examples: api, frontend, backend, config, docs, tests
#
# Subject should use imperative mood: "change" not "changed" nor "changes"
# Don't capitalize first letter
# No dot (.) at the end
#
# Body should explain the motivation for the change and contrast with previous behavior
#
# Footer should contain any information about Breaking Changes and is also the place to reference GitHub issues
# Breaking Changes should start with "BREAKING CHANGE:"
#
# Example:
# ----------------
# feat(api): add data source health monitoring
#
# Implement real-time health check for all data providers
# with automatic failover and alert notifications
#
# Closes #123
